province = 73
blurb = "Depicts people admiring a miraculous gourd that appeared at the birth of Prince Shōtoku, guarded by a sacred snake.

[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prince_Sh%C5%8Dtoku]Prince Shōtoku[/url] (574-622) was a semi-legendary regent and a politician of the Asuka period in Japan who served under Empress Suiko. He is regarded as a protector of Buddhism in Japan.

According to legend, around the time of Prince Shōtoku's birth, a mysterious gourd grew in the garden of Emaro in Sanuki Province. As the gourd grew to a great size, images of holy sages and written characters appeared on it, and a sacred snake came to protect it."
